    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scary Cargo</strong> is a 1\u20134 player co-op survival horror game about delivering cargo through cursed, monster-infested zones.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your mission sounds simple</strong>: deliver the cargo and stay alive.<br>But when one of you dies, they might not stay dead.<br>They\u2019ll look the same. Sound the same.<br>And they\u2019ll remember everything: the plan, the route\u2026 even you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_strike\"><strong>Trust</strong></span> no one.<br>Finish the job. Or be finished... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617830/extras/ad4a45b0f8e59267877e320524346206.avif?t=1748541049\" data-has-big width=800 height=150 /></span>\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617830/extras/c0de32cf719e4d99e689e0819789cff1.poster.avif?t=1748541049\" width=628 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617830/extras/c0de32cf719e4d99e689e0819789cff1.webm?t=1748541049\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><strong>**It doesn\u2019t blink. It doesn\u2019t need to.**  </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not every monster needs claws. Some just need to see you\u2014and you freeze.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617830/extras/5a687be769a396d08ff61f2da2b74fd1.poster.avif?t=1748541049\" width=628 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617830/extras/5a687be769a396d08ff61f2da2b74fd1.webm?t=1748541049\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><strong>**You\u2019re being chased by a dragon. Seriously.**  </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Scary Cargo, even the open streets aren\u2019t safe. When danger comes from above, your only option is to run\u2014and pray.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617830/extras/e3193afcd010b6b2c6e5d0a66c5d730d.poster.avif?t=1748541049\" width=628 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617830/extras/e3193afcd010b6b2c6e5d0a66c5d730d.webm?t=1748541049\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><strong>**Step out, scream in.**</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nobody says hello. Just roars, claws, and really bad social skills.\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617830/extras/3dfee60ed99281ed6ebe060d2ed5f119.poster.avif?t=1748541049\" width=628 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617830/extras/3dfee60ed99281ed6ebe060d2ed5f119.webm?t=1748541049\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><strong>**It waits for eye contact.**</strong>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You looked back. He took that personally. Some monsters don\u2019t attack\u2014until you make eye contact. \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617830/extras/8304fbba5c36437a56f5873ac1c1faa0.poster.avif?t=1748541049\" width=628 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617830/extras/8304fbba5c36437a56f5873ac1c1faa0.webm?t=1748541049\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><strong>**They don\u2019t hide. You just look wrong.**</strong>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some monsters spawn where you\u2019re not looking. Turning your head might be all it takes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617830/extras/1249a5d3eda7f0b8b15b51d737d0b417.avif?t=1748541049\" data-has-big width=800 height=80 /></span><u><strong>1\u20134 Player Chaos</strong></u><strong>:</strong> Online co-op, maximum panic, questionable teamwork.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Proximity Voice Chat</strong></u><strong>:</strong> Perfect for screaming, betraying, or blaming each other.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Turn into Monsters</strong></u><strong>:</strong> Dying is just a promotion to the other side. Enjoy hunting your friends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Weapons vs Panic</strong></u><strong>:</strong> Guns help, but running helps more. Pick wisely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Replayable Mayhem</strong></u><strong>:</strong> Every delivery is a unique disaster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 </p>",
